FROM --platform=$BUILDPLATFORM golang:1.27.4-alpine3.23@sha256:f70850ef6ce341e8b6427f677049145d63c0b7ce002d4d7e3d464828b1b96dcd AS build
WORKDIR /src
COPY apps/api/go.mod apps/api/go.sum ./
RUN --mount=type=cache,target=/go/pkg/mod go mod download
COPY apps/api/ ./
ARG TARGETOS
ARG TARGETARCH
ARG VERSION=dev
RUN --mount=type=cache,target=/go/pkg/mod --mount=type=cache,target=/root/.cache/go-build \
    CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=$TARGETOS GOARCH=$TARGETARCH go build -trimpath -buildvcs=false -ldflags="-s -w -X main.version=$VERSION" -o /out/api ./cmd/api
FROM gcr.io/distroless/static-debian13:nonroot@sha256:f7f8f729987ad0fdf6b05eeeae94b26e6a0f613bdf46feea7fc40f7bd72953e6
WORKDIR /app
COPY --from=build --chown=nonroot:nonroot /out/api /app/api
USER nonroot:nonroot
EXPOSE 8080
HEALTHCHECK --interval=30s --timeout=6s CMD ["/app/api", "healthcheck"]
ENTRYPOINT ["/app/api"]
